herdbook-pane is a modified copy of the `pane` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: main.js shows the terminal's `pane-name` label as
the pane's name; a double-click opens herdbook-rename, a right-click opens
herdbook-menu, and a "Move to another space" button (move-space.svg, added)
opens its move list. Entries for a mod that isn't installed don't show. Asset
paths were renamed from mods/pane/ to mods/herdbook-pane/ by Herdr's mod.clone.
